    "$t": "Gōng-gōng等"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<iframe allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RJp20I5HeIk\" width=\"560\"></iframe><br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><br />\n</span></b></div>\n</div>\n<br /><br />▍Gōng-gōng等<br /><br />作者：蔡雲雀<br /><br />一欉樹一透早gōng-gōng等一群鳥影<br /><br />一个魚池等待冬去春來ê魚影<br /><br />膨鼠等待春暖tī樹頭tsǹg來tsǹg去<br /><br />一pha路燈tī暗暝tshiō--leh<br /><br />Gōng-gōng等待月娘kap天星<br /><br />父母等待我細漢ê ǹg望<a href=\"https://www.blogger.com/null\"></a><br /><br />親像雲tī-leh等待日頭仝款<br /><br />Guán tī美人樹跤金金看<br /><br />等待花開花謝<br /><br />Suah等著山櫻花一phiàn ê粉紅<br /><br />不知gōng-gōng等--ê是guán<br /><br />Iah是he等待春天ê花欉<br />"
  },
